# a chevron) that opens a panel with the members (avatars, Add friend, the right-click player menu), invite,
# ready / play again, and the party chat (scripts/chat_view.gd). Collapsed by default; click the header (pad A),
# click outside, Esc (pad B) closes it; remembered for the session; opens by itself for a few seconds when someone
# joins or an invite is accepted. Your own avatar opens the picture picker (scripts/avatar_ui.gd).
