	"ysolde": {"text": "The Brightmeres swore their oath to the moon before there was a Ward to swear to, and Ysolde still keeps it: she hunts only by moonlight, and never alone. Her glaives were forged from a fallen star in the shape of the crescent that fell with it. Those who fight beside her say they feel steadier, braver, sharper; she says it is only the light."},
